      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "El que mandaba en esa parte de Oʻahu era Olopana, hermano de su padre.",
          "en": "The ruling chief of that part of Oʻahu was Olopana, his father's brother."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y a Kamapuaʻa le encantaba hacerle travesuras.",
          "en": "And Kamapuaʻa loved to cause him trouble."
        },
        {
          "es": "Un gallo mágico lo guiaba de noche hasta el gallinero de Olopana. Y Kamapuaʻa se robaba las gallinas.",
          "en": "A magic rooster led him at night to Olopana's hen house. And Kamapuaʻa stole the chickens."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los guardias lo atraparon cuatro veces, con forma de cerdo, y lo ataron a un palo.",
          "en": "Four times the guards caught him in his pig shape, and tied him to a pole."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y las cuatro veces, la abuela cantó un hechizo, y él quedó libre.",
          "en": "And four times, his grandmother chanted a spell, and he was free again."
        }
      ],
