      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Al final, toda la región se levantó contra él. Los guerreros rodearon el valle de Kaliuwaʻa, donde vivía su familia.",
          "en": "In the end, the whole district rose against him. Warriors surrounded the valley of Kaliuwaʻa, where his family lived."
        },
        {
          "es": "No había salida. Detrás de ellos había un acantilado altísimo.",
          "en": "There was no way out. Behind them stood a towering cliff."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces Kamapuaʻa se apoyó contra la roca y estiró su cuerpo hasta arriba, como un puente.",
          "en": "Then Kamapuaʻa leaned against the rock and stretched his body all the way up, like a bridge."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su familia subió por su espalda y escapó por arriba.",
          "en": "His family climbed up his back and escaped over the top."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Te habrías animado a subir por la espalda de un hombre cerdo gigante?",
          "en": "Would you have dared to climb up the back of a giant pig-man?"
        }
      ],
